{`v`:`story_v1`,`room`:`BIZ`,`title`:`From One Glass of Lemonade`,`titleVN`:`T\u1eeb c\u1ed1c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh`,`cast`:[{`name`:`Hien`,`vn`:`Hi\u1ec1n, c\u00f4 b\u00e9 15 tu\u1ed5i b\u00e1n n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh \u1edf c\u1ed5ng ch\u1ee3, nhanh tr\u00ed v\u00e0 li\u1ec1u`},{`name`:`Sen`,`vn`:`c\u00f4 b\u00e9 12 tu\u1ed5i, con g\u00e1i c\u00f4 Hu\u1ec7 b\u00e1n hoa qu\u1ea3 trong ch\u1ee3, gi\u1ecfi t\u00ednh to\u00e1n`},{`name`:`Nam`,`vn`:`c\u1eadu b\u00e9 16 tu\u1ed5i, l\u1eadp k\u00eanh Radio Lotus tr\u00ean g\u00e1c nh\u00e0 s\u1ed1 4`}],`ch`:[{`floor`:`A2`,`part`:1,`parts`:1,`title`:`People Are Thirsty!`,`titleVN`:`Tr\u1eddi n\u00f3ng, ai c\u0169ng kh\u00e1t!`,`words`:`business|company|product|factory|advertising|advertisement|advertise|service|businessman|manage|director|manager|accounting|industry`,`paras`:[{`en`:`[[It]] [[was|be]] [[a]] [[hot]] [[summer]], [[and]] Hien [[had|have]] [[a]] [[plan]]. \`[[People]] [[are|be]] [[thirsty]]!\` [[she]] [[said|say]]. \`[[I]] [[want]] [[to]] [[start]] [[a]] [[business]].\` [[She]] [[put]] [[a]] [[small]] [[table]] [[at]] [[the]] [[gate]] [[of]] Lotus Market. [[Her]] [[sign]] [[said|say]]: Hien's Lemonade [[Company]].`,`vn`:`M\u00f9a h\u00e8 n\u0103m \u1ea5y n\u00f3ng nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ed5 l\u1eeda, v\u00e0 Hi\u1ec1n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch. \`Tr\u1eddi n\u00f3ng, ai c\u0169ng kh\u00e1t!\` c\u00f4 b\u00e9 n\u00f3i. \`M\u00ecnh mu\u1ed1n kinh doanh.\` Hi\u1ec1n k\u00ea m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc b\u00e0n nh\u1ecf \u1edf c\u1ed5ng ch\u1ee3 Hoa Sen. T\u1ea5m bi\u1ec3n ghi: C\u00f4ng ty N\u01b0\u1edbc chanh Hi\u1ec1n.`},{`en`:`[[Her]] [[product]] [[was|be]] [[simple]]: [[fresh]] [[lemons|lemon]], [[sugar]], [[water]] [[and]] [[ice]]. [[But]] [[nobody]] [[stopped|stop]]. [[The]] [[shop]] [[across]] [[the]] [[road]] [[sold|sell]] [[cold]] [[drinks|drink]] [[from]] [[a]] [[factory]]. \`[[Factory]] [[drinks|drink]] [[are|be]] [[too]] [[sweet]],\` [[said|say]] Hien. \`[[My]] [[product]] [[is|be]] [[fresh]]!\``,`vn`:`S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a Hi\u1ec1n r\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n: chanh t\u01b0\u01a1i, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng, n\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1. Nh\u01b0ng ch\u1eb3ng ai d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i. C\u1eeda h\u00e0ng b\u00ean kia \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng b\u00e1n n\u01b0\u1edbc ng\u1ecdt c\u1ee7a nh\u00e0 m\u00e1y. \`N\u01b0\u1edbc nh\u00e0 m\u00e1y ng\u1ecdt qu\u00e1,\` Hi\u1ec1n n\u00f3i. \`S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh t\u01b0\u01a1i c\u01a1 m\u00e0!\``},{`en`:`Sen [[had|have]] an [[idea]]. \`[[You]] [[need]] [[advertising]].\` \`[[Advertising]] [[is|be]] [[expensive]],\` [[said|say]] Hien. \`[[Not]] [[on]] Radio Lotus,\` [[said|say]] Sen. [[That]] [[afternoon]], Nam [[put]] Hien [[on]] [[his]] [[radio]] [[show]]. \`You're [[on]] Radio Lotus!\` [[he]] [[shouted|shout]]. [[Her]] [[advertisement]] [[was|be]] [[short]]: \`[[Hot]]? [[Come]] [[to]] [[the]] [[market]] [[gate]]!\` Nam [[advertised|advertise]] [[it]] [[every]] [[hour]], [[and]] Hien [[paid|pay]] [[him]] [[with]] [[one]] [[free]] [[glass]] [[a]] [[day]].`,`vn`:`C\u00f4 b\u1ea1n Sen n\u1ea3y ra m\u1ed9t \u00fd. \`Ch\u1ecb c\u1ea7n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.\` \`Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1eaft l\u1eafm,\` Hi\u1ec1n n\u00f3i. \`Tr\u00ean Radio Lotus th\u00ec kh\u00f4ng,\` Sen \u0111\u00e1p. Chi\u1ec1u h\u00f4m \u0111\u00f3, Nam cho Hi\u1ec1n l\u00ean s\u00f3ng. \`B\u1ea1n \u0111ang nghe Radio Lotus!\` c\u1eadu h\u00f4 to. M\u1ea9u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o r\u1ea5t ng\u1eafn: \`N\u00f3ng \u00e0? Ra c\u1ed5ng ch\u1ee3 ngay!\` Nam ph\u00e1t n\u00f3 m\u1ed7i ti\u1ebfng m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n, v\u00e0 Hi\u1ec1n tr\u1ea3 c\u00f4ng c\u1eadu b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t c\u1ed1c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y.`},{`en`:`[[The]] [[next]] [[day]], [[there]] [[was|be]] [[a]] [[long]] [[line]] [[at]] [[her]] [[table]]. \`[[Good]] [[service]] [[is|be]] [[half]] [[the]] [[business]],\` [[said|say]] Hien. [[A]] [[businessman]] [[drank|drink]] [[three]] [[glasses|glass]]. \`[[Can]] [[you]] [[manage]] [[alone]]?\` [[he]] [[asked|ask]]. \`[[I]] [[can]] [[manage]],\` [[said|say]] Hien, [[with]] [[lemon]] [[juice]] [[on]] [[her]] [[nose]].`,`vn`:`H\u00f4m sau, tr\u01b0\u1edbc b\u00e0n c\u1ee7a Hi\u1ec1n c\u00f3 c\u1ea3 m\u1ed9t h\u00e0ng d\u00e0i. \`Ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 t\u1ed1t l\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng m\u1ed9t n\u1eeda,\` Hi\u1ec1n n\u00f3i. M\u1ed9t doanh nh\u00e2n u\u1ed1ng li\u1ec1n ba c\u1ed1c. \`Ch\u00e1u xoay x\u1edf m\u1ed9t m\u00ecnh n\u1ed5i kh\u00f4ng?\` \u00f4ng h\u1ecfi. \`Ch\u00e1u xoay x\u1edf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1ea1,\` Hi\u1ec1n \u0111\u00e1p, m\u0169i v\u1eabn c\u00f2n d\u00ednh n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh.`},{`en`:`[[He]] [[read]] [[her]] [[sign]]. \`[[Who]] [[is|be]] [[the]] [[director]] [[of]] [[this]] [[company]]?\` \`[[Me]],\` [[said|say]] Hien. \`[[And]] [[the]] [[manager]]?\` \`[[Me]].\` \`[[And]] [[who]] [[does|do]] [[the]] [[accounting]]?\` Sen [[put]] [[up]] [[her]] [[hand]]. \`[[Me]]! [[For]] [[one]] [[free]] [[glass]] [[a]] [[day]].\` [[The]] [[man]] [[laughed|laugh]]. \`[[The]] [[smallest|small]] [[company]] [[in]] [[the]] [[drinks|drink]] [[industry]]!\``,`vn`:`\u00d4ng doanh nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ecdc t\u1ea5m bi\u1ec3n. \`Ai l\u00e0 gi\u00e1m \u0111\u1ed1c c\u00f4ng ty n\u00e0y?\` \`Ch\u00e1u \u1ea1,\` Hi\u1ec1n n\u00f3i. \`C\u00f2n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd?\` \`C\u0169ng ch\u00e1u.\` \`Th\u1ebf ai l\u00e0m k\u1ebf to\u00e1n?\` Sen gi\u01a1 tay. \`Ch\u00e1u \u1ea1! C\u00f4ng tr\u1ea3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u1ed1c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y.\` \u00d4ng b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`C\u00f4ng ty nh\u1ecf nh\u1ea5t ng\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed3 u\u1ed1ng \u0111\u00e2y r\u1ed3i!\``},{`en`:`[[Every]] [[morning]], [[the]] [[plant]] [[in]] [[the]] [[upstairs]] [[window]] [[of]] [[the]] [[house]] [[with]] [[the]] [[blue]] [[door]] [[was|be]] [[wet]]. [[By]] [[evening]], [[every]] [[lemon]] [[was|be]] [[gone|go]]. [[Then]] [[the]] [[market]] [[manager]] [[came|come]] [[to]] [[her]] [[table]]. \`[[Who]] [[allowed|allow]] [[you]] [[to]] [[sell]] [[here]]?\` [[he]] [[asked|ask]].`,`vn`:`S\u00e1ng n\u00e0o ch\u1eadu c\u00e2y \u1edf c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 t\u1ea7ng tr\u00ean c\u1ee7a ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 c\u1eeda xanh c\u0169ng \u01b0\u1edbt \u0111\u1eabm nh\u01b0 v\u1eeba \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0\u1edbi. \u0110\u1ebfn t\u1ed1i, ch\u1ed7 chanh c\u1ee7a Hi\u1ec1n \u0111\u00e3 b\u00e1n h\u1ebft s\u1ea1ch. R\u1ed3i \u00f4ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd ch\u1ee3 \u0111i \u0111\u1ebfn b\u00e0n. \`Ai cho ph\u00e9p ch\u00e1u b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u1edf \u0111\u00e2y?\` \u00f4ng h\u1ecfi.`}],`tease`:`Li\u1ec7u qu\u1ea7y n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh c\u1ee7a Hi\u1ec1n c\u00f3 b\u1ecb d\u1eb9p ngay sau ng\u00e0y b\u00e1n \u0111\u1eaft nh\u1ea5t?`}]}